  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_block.header": "Using the Redstone Announcer",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_block.text_1": "The Redstone Announcer plays custom text-to-speech voice announcements",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_block.text_2": "Right-click the block to configure text, voice, pitch, reverb, and effects",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_block.text_3": "Power the Announcer with a Redstone signal to trigger the announcement",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_block.text_4": "While playing, the announcer lights up and broadcasts audio to nearby players",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_block.text_5": "Optional jingles (such as DB Gong) can be configured to play before, after, or both!",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.configurable_announcer_block.header": "Automating Station Announcements",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.configurable_announcer_block.text_1": "The Configurable Announcer automates announcements for your train network",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.configurable_announcer_block.text_2": "Right-click a Station or Track Observer with the Announcer item to link it",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.configurable_announcer_block.text_3": "In the UI, use 'Auto-Fetch' to automatically populate trains scheduled for this station",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.configurable_announcer_block.text_4": "Each train can have completely customized announcement text, voice, and effects",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.configurable_announcer_block.text_5": "When a scheduled train arrives, the Announcer triggers automatically!",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.train_announcer_block.header": "Using the Train-Mounted Announcer",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.train_announcer_block.text_1": "The Train-Mounted Announcer is placed directly on train carriages",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.train_announcer_block.text_2": "Right-click to configure announcements for each arriving station, even while assembled",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.train_announcer_block.text_3": "Use 'Auto-Fetch' to automatically load stations from the train schedule",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.train_announcer_block.text_4": "Upon arriving at a configured station, the announcer plays inside the train!",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.train_announcer_block.text_5": "Enable 'Train Only' in the effects tab so only passengers on the train hear the broadcast",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.speaker_block.header": "Using Speakers as Audio Relays",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.speaker_block.text_1": "Speakers act as secondary audio sources for Announcer blocks",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.speaker_block.text_2": "Right-click any Announcer with the Speaker item in hand to link them",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.speaker_block.text_3": "When the Announcer plays, all linked Speakers broadcast the audio simultaneously!",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.speaker_block.text_4": "Distribute speakers around stations and platforms so announcements are heard everywhere",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_display_link.header": "Displaying Announcements on Screens",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_display_link.text_1": "Display Links can read announcements from Announcer blocks",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_display_link.text_2": "First, right-click the target display board, sign, or nixie tube...",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_display_link.text_3": "...then place the Display Link against an Announcer block",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_display_link.text_4": "In the interface, customize the label and choose between 'While Playing' or 'Keep Displayed'",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_display_link.text_5": "When an announcement is played, the fitting text is immediately sent to the display!",
  "create_station_voices.ponder.announcer_display_link.text_6": "This works with Redstone Announcers, Configurable Train Announcers, and linked Speakers",
